    "narrative": "The Austin Waves head into today\u2019s slate with a lineup anchored by the high-upside potential of **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.**, who leads our daily efficiency rankings at 76.75. Facing Liberatore, **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** benefits from a favorable platoon split and an assumed spot in the heart of the order, making him our safest bet for reliable production. **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (71.49) and **Gunnar Henderson** (67.14) follow closely as primary offensive drivers. While **Gunnar Henderson** faces a daunting matchup against Zack Wheeler, his efficiency score is buoyed significantly by a +16% park factor and dynamic platoon advantages. However, managers should monitor the 41% rain risk surrounding **Gunnar Henderson**; if a delay or cancellation seems imminent, we will pivot to maintain our weekly game cap strategy.\n\nThe decision to start **Jacob Wilson** (66.25) over the bench options proved pivotal, as his +10% park factor and lead-off projected spot provide the necessary volume to outweigh the lower-ceiling outcomes of our reserves. Among the bench, **Jorge Polanco** (49.12) was the closest candidate to cracking the lineup. Ultimately, **Jorge Polanco** was excluded because his projected production against Sandy Alcantara lacked the situational platoon edge required to surpass the efficiency scores of **Luis Robert Jr.** or **Heliot Ramos**. While **Luis Robert Jr.** (51.38) carries a lower efficiency due to a tough draw against Alcantara, his pedigree and situational upside keep him in the outfield rotation over the more stagnant bench options. \n\nWe are also monitoring the impact of elite opposing catcher defense on our stolen base targets. Both **Jackson Merrill** and **Gunnar Henderson** face battery mates known for elite throw-out times (1.86s), which slightly suppresses their efficiency scores by penalizing potential base-stealing opportunities. Despite this, we are leaning into the aggressiveness of **Andy Pages** (62.47), whose score reflects a positive matchup against a slower-delivering pitcher, potentially opening a window for him to provide the scarce speed we need to maintain our competitive edge in the category. All lineup positions remain subject to minor adjustment once official batting orders are confirmed.",
